# Top-level research/ was retired to _archive/ in the 2026-07-10 consolidation;
# the live surface is 03-work/agent-context/zz-research/. What remains here is
# either tier-3 (personal-workflow/, above) or vault chrome. `research/learnings/`
# is exempted below: worklogs wikilink to it, so a dangling link is worse than
# tracking two tier-2-clean notes.
research/.obsidian/
!research/learnings/

# Private / gated
03-work/homelab/

# Fedora Claude containment is canonical and tracked under profiles/watchdog/.
